/*
  core/masks/careless_calc.spthy -- f_H for the NEW Careless mask, CALC_SK action.
  (Plan §3: the Unmotivated / disengaged user.)

  Careless is the DISENGAGEMENT failure mode, distinct from Busy: where Busy SLIPS
  (produces a wrong key -> unsafe completion), Careless TIMES OUT -- it gives up and
  produces no response at all, so the ceremony safely STALLS (safe-fail, plan §2).
  Careless is the CURRENT mask (gated by core/transitions/mask_state.spthy via RespMask, set by
  the Shift rule once ExternalDistraction is active). It still emits Answered(rid) -- the request
  slot is spent -- but produces NO KeyResult, so Alex can never send ACK. timeout() is the outcome.
*/

rule Calc_Careless_timeout:
    [ !Req(P, rid, 'CALC_SK', <Na,Nb>, c) ]
  --[ Calc(P,'Careless'), RespMask(P,'Careless'), Mask(P,'Attentive','Careless'), Timeout(P), Answered(rid) ]->
    [ ]
